                                "sense_id": "d89cf1b5-06ef-3551-b909-a4a6c09f574e",
                                "text": "L’hôtesse, un coup d’ riquiqui ! / Ça rend les marins poilus / D’boire à la santé d’ceux qui / N’boit plus.",
                                "translation": "Landlady, a glass of brandy! / It puts hair on sailors' chests / To drink to the health of those who / Can't drink any more.",
